# NMKRebar multi-version build

After implementing or changing NMKRebar, always build all three debug configurations and report each result:

```
dotnet build NMKRebar/NMKRebar.csproj -c D2022
dotnet build NMKRebar/NMKRebar.csproj -c D2026
dotnet build NMKRebar/NMKRebar.csproj -c D2027
```

Do not stop after a single version. Prefer `NMKRebar/build.ps1` when available.
